This is a direct replacement for CNet's main menu prompt.

For users of access level 30 and below, it shows the following:

Current Time: HH:MM:SS   Time Online: HH:MM:SS   Remaining Time: HH:MM:SS

(Access Level)(?=Menu) Main:

For level 31, it just shows:

(Console) Main:

To use, replace what's on line #68 in your bbstext with the following:

{#0PFiles:MainMenuLine}

The above { is actually a control-Q commands and remember to modify the
path to where you placed the "MainMenuLine" script.

Also, I've left this one uncompiled so you can play around with it,
modify it to suit.  Have fun...
